sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as CLI / API Consumer
    participant API as src/api.ts (scan / scanWarm)
    participant Cache as CacheStore (L1 + L2)
    participant Router as SparseMoEGateRouter
    participant Native as Rust N-API / NativeBridge
    participant Scorer as Static QualityScorer (10-Dim & 8-Pillar)
    participant Fusion as RiskFusionEngine (Tri-Plane Q_total)
    participant Autonomy as AutonomyScorer (CAI 2.0 & Jeffreys Beta)
    participant Finalizer as finalizeReport (Ratchet & Ledger)

    Caller->>API: 1. Invoke scan(options)
    API->>Cache: 2. Probe L1/L2 cache by Composite Fingerprint
    Cache-->>API: Return cached clean files & dependency edges
    API->>Router: 3. Compute active analyzers for dirty files (CED MoE)
    Router->>Native: 4. Execute oxc Mode A + ops-mask + ops-graph + ops-clone
    Native-->>API: Emit normalized issues + AST + SemanticGraph edges
    API->>Scorer: 5. Compute static 10-dim indices (hyperbolic decay & security ceiling)
    Scorer-->>API: Return static score & 8 primary pillars breakdown
    API->>Fusion: 6. Fuse static + dynamic telemetry + history (Risk = S^1.0 · D^1.2 · H^0.8)
    Fusion-->>API: Return cross-plane fused risks & Q_total unified score
    API->>Autonomy: 7. Evaluate 6-dim in-house autonomy & Jeffreys Beta(0.5, 0.5) credible interval
    Autonomy-->>API: Return CAI composite index, L1~L5 grade, SDK inventory
    API->>Finalizer: 8. Execute suppressions, cycle validation, Baseline 1.2.0 ratchet, append ledger
    Finalizer-->>Caller: 9. Emit complete deterministic ScanReport (JSON / SARIF / Text)
